WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.720
It's fun to stay at the YMCA!

00:00:04.060 --> 00:00:07.580
It's fun to stay at the YMCA!

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:12.520
They have everything for young men to enjoy!

00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:15.200
You can hang out with all the boys!

00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:18.780
It's fun to stay at the YMCA!

00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:22.580
It's fun to stay at the YMCA!

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:25.660
You can get yourself clean!

00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:27.540
You can have a good meal!

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:31.320
You can do whatever you feel

00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:35.040
Young man, are you listening to me?

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:38.820
I said, young man, what do you want to be?

00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:42.700
I said, young man, you can make brilliant dreams

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:47.100
But you've got to know this one thing

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:50.220
Young man does it all by himself

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:54.040
I said, young man, put your pride on the shelf

00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:55.620
And just go there

00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:57.700
To the YMCA

00:00:57.700 --> 00:00:59.680
I'm sure they can
